# Routing decision record

Use one record per consequential or changed route. The canonical routing procedures remain in
`skills/model-routing-table/` and `skills/fleet-model-routing/`; this record prevents a decision from
being remembered as folklore.

| Field | Record |
|---|---|
| Task shape, consequence, required artifact | `<task and observable acceptance condition>` |
| Candidate local lane, availability, measured step budget | `<lane, availability observation, budget>` |
| Decomposition attempted / why unsafe | `<bounded split tried, or reason it changes correctness>` |
| Escalation route and trigger | `<route; evidence-triggered threshold>` |
| Cloud cost cap or subscription posture | `<cap or subscription constraint>` |
| Effort level and approval reference | `<standing effort or approved bump>` |
| Verification result and next table update | `<literal result; date/owner of routing-table update>` |

